     "data": "This volume provides a critical analysis of the manner in which the Israeli Supreme Court has dealt with petitions relating to the actions and policies of the Israeli authorities in the West Bank and Gaza, which were occupied by Israel in 1967. It offers an exhaustive analysis of the Court's decisions on a variety of topics, including civilian settlements, the separation barrier, punitive house demolitions, and conduct of hostilities.",
